# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere, so the built copies are byte-for-byte the same on Windows and on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.djvu binary
*.npy binary
# Ciechanowski's Mechanical Watch is kept byte for byte as the site serves it (its manifest's sha256).
References/ciechanowski-mechanical-watch/** -text
